The '''Klatooinian raiders'''<ref name="Handbook" /> operated on the [[planet]] [[Sorgan]]<ref name="Chapter 4" /> in [[9 ABY]].<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|4}}</ref> Comprised of [[Klatooinian]] raiders and the [[AT-ST Raider]], the tribe launched attacks on a [[Unidentified village (Sorgan)|remote village]], killing villagers and robbing them. Afterwards, the village hired the Mandalorian [[Din Djarin]] and [[Carasynthia Dune]] for protection. After a scouting mission, Djarin noted that he thought there were at least fifteen raiders. Later, a [[Skirmish on Sorgan|skirmish]] took place that resulted in the destruction of the AT-ST Raider and the deaths of several Klatooinian raiders, and ended with the tribe being repelled from the village.<ref name="Chapter 4" />

{{Stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]'' mistakenly states that Klatooinian raiders were [[Nikto]].

